	(text "J_DATA_RPI, J_EN_RPI, J_CLK_RPI \nare headers connected to RPI\n\nJ_EN_3.3 should connect to VDD (manually switch on EN)\n\nCLK_SC, SBUS6 pins are connected to breadboard\n\nDIRECT_DATA_SBUS is the header that direcly access to DATA_SBUS6 chip pin\n\nDIRECT_CLK is the header that direcly access to CLK chip pin"
